# Free key: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html  (~60 seconds)
# Required only for true point-in-time macro vintages (ALFRED real-time history).
# Without it, the FRED source falls back to current vintages + a conservative
# publication lag, which is documented as second-best in docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md.
FRED_API_KEY=
